  "description": "DAQJEM crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P c c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H80 Dy8 N36 O40,6(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1D (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2D (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3D (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4D (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.749-3.823 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.05-110.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8(OH)6(OMe)6(cmnm)10(ccnm)2(H2O)2(MeOH)2]·3H2O·10MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
